      "id": "claim_f623c1e082e0423e9bd96e9a7d237738",
      "statement": "The Mississippi HO-3 (2018-09) defines “sudden and accidental” as “abrupt, unintended, and unexpected” and covers sudden and accidental escape of water or steam from specified internal systems, but not loss to the system or appliance from which it escaped; the 2024 edition likewise grants coverage for accidental internal discharge or overflow while excluding the failed system or appliance.",
